 },
 "5386": {
  "inputs": {
   "value": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the black-haired dragon girl in <Picture 1>: black hair in a high ponytail with a red ribbon, blue dragon horns with red roots at the base, amber eyes, a small red marking on the forehead, teal-blue cropped jacket over a white high-collar shirt, light pleated mini-skirt, black over-knee boots with silver knee guards, a teal dragon tail with magenta-pink tips. All appearance, costume and identifying features strictly follow <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 2> is the white-haired fox girl in <Picture 2>: white hair with teal under-layers in a high ponytail tied with a red cord, white feathered fox ears, a red marking at the center of the forehead, black techwear coat, red stockings, black sneakers. All appearance, costume and identifying features strictly follow <Picture 2>.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] Continuation. <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> stand together watching the sea as a wave recedes. Final segment of the chain. Hold from previous segment ending. Three shots: hold, medium standing together, wide final.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - all visual attributes from <Picture 1> maintained throughout.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - all visual attributes from <Picture 2> maintained throughout.\n\ndetailed_description:\nStylized 2D anime rendering, golden-hour beach with the sun low on the horizon to the screen-right, warm amber rim light tracing every silhouette edge, soft diffused backlight creating a halo on hair and features, deep amber-to-rose sky above a muted teal ocean, warm color palette, cinematic 16:9 widescreen.\n\n[Shot 1] A close-up of both faces, <Subject 1>'s and <Subject 2>'s lips just parted, the foreheads still close, <Subject 1>'s fingers at the base of <Subject 2>'s skull. Only micro-movements: the lips tremble slightly, parting and re-closing; <Subject 2>'s fox ears shift in the breeze, the white feathers catching the light; both breathe, the warm breath visible as a faint mist against the other's skin. The camera holds a static shot.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:01.700, the shot cuts to a medium shot from the waist up. <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> pull apart slightly, the bodies creating a small gap, the teal jacket and black coat no longer pressed together. Both stand facing the ocean, the amber sun a low disc on the horizon. <Subject 1>'s hand finds <Subject 2>'s hand, the fingers interlacing, the silver ring visible on <Subject 1>'s ring finger, catching the last direct sunlight. <Subject 2>'s fox ears rotate to their natural upright angle, the white feathers flaring slightly. <Subject 1>'s dragon tail curls gently behind the legs, the magenta-pink tips brushing the wet sand. The camera holds a static shot.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:03.500, the shot cuts to a wide shot of the beach. <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> are small figures at the screen-center, standing close together, the amber sun a low disc on the horizon to the screen-right. A wave rolls in from the screen-right, the white foam reaching the base of the dark volcanic rocks, then receding slowly, the wet sand gleaming in the fading light. The two figures stand still, the silhouettes sharp against the amber sky, the dragon tail and fox ears catching the last rim light. The camera holds a static shot.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nWaves rolling in and receding, the foam hissing on the wet sand. Wind moving through hair and fabric. The soft sound of fingers interlacing. The ocean hush growing slightly louder as the wave recedes, then settling into a steady, low rhythm.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\ncontinues, fading out over the final two seconds, the piano figures thinning to a single sustained note that dissolves into silence.\n"
  },
